    "description": "This posh boutique hotel on Portici Beach lies 1.6 km from Maurice Bishop International Airport.\nFeaturing boho-chic decor, the detached and semi-detached cottages come with free Wi-Fi, flat-screens, and tea and coffeemakers. All also have plunge pools, open-air bathrooms, and sea-view verandas. Some offer private lawns, and luxe, modern 5-bedroom villas add infinity pools, kitchens and indoor/outdoor living spaces. Room service is available.\nPerks include Italian dining, plus a bar by the seafront outdoor pool, and a beach pavilion with free daily yoga. There's also an Asian spa and a fitness room, along with water sports equipment."
